# He I (he_top) n=2 transitions missing from he_top_lines.dat: one forbidden radiative
# line and four collision-only (f = 0) entries.  They exist so that collisional
# excitation/de-excitation couples these levels; the matching collision strengths are in
# he_top_upsilon_coll.dat, which must be read after this file.
#   1-2  1s2 1S  - 1s2s 3S   M1, A = 1.27e-4 s^-1 (f from A, he_top energies)
#   2-3  1s2s 3S - 1s2s 1S   collision only
#   2-5  1s2s 3S - 1s2p 1P   collision only
#   3-4  1s2s 1S - 1s2p 3P   collision only
#   4-5  1s2p 3P - 1s2p 1P   collision only
# Wavelengths are from the he_top level energies so that the CSTREN records match exactly.
#        z ion       lambda      f         gl  gu    el          eu        ll   lu
